# The web image builds from the repo ROOT (the pnpm workspace: root lockfile + catalog, ADR-071),
# so this file (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile) keeps the context to
# what the build copies. The image runs its own pnpm install: local installs and builds stay out.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!patches/**
!web/**
!packages/**
**/node_modules/
web/build/
web/build-admin/
web/.react-router/
